  "description": "A quick heads up",
  "body_html": "<p>I don’t know where the top is for Rigetti, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$RGTI&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>. I don’t know how useful or impactful Quantum Computing will be in a year or 10 years. Nor do I know if tomorrow we will get a triple witching. Or if prices will hold this weekend. Your magic eight ball works the same as mine. </p><p><strong>What I do know</strong>, is I am sitting on ~54% in profit. And there is a lot of news coming out about Rigetti and quantum computing. This means retail investors are going to show interest….and 90% of retail doesn’t do that great. These articles below, were just released today…that is ALOT of news for a smaller market cap company:</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.investing.com/news/company-news/rigetti-computing-stock-hits-alltime-high-at-2144-usd-93CH-4243008\">Investing.com talking about Rigetti hitting all time high</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.sharewise.com/us/news_articles/Will_Rigettis_CDAC_Partnership_Translate_Into_New_Revenue_Streams_Zacks_20250917_1639\">Will Rigetti’s C-DAC partnership translate into new revenue streams?</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.barrons.com/articles/rigetti-computing-stock-ionq-quantuml-2021bdda\">Rigetti Stock rises 14% after landing Air Force Award ($5.8 million dollar contract)</a></p></li></ul><p>Maybe I am cashing out way too early. Maybe it goes to $250 a share. That’s ok with me. I can always get back in if I want. Ultimately, you do what is best for you. I just follow the mindset of not letting a good profit go. </p><p>I like looking at stocks when no one else is…too many are looking at Rigetti now. However, if you didn’t see my post this morning…<a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/buying-more-of-this-stock-market?r=4z8lgl\">No one is looking at this company, and I just bought more…</a> check that out. Pretty optimistic.</p><p>You do what is best for you! I am not financial advisor. Just some dude on the internet who can identify good chart set ups. Most of the time…not always. My job is to get you into profit…not time tops. Have a great day! </p><p><em>For more visit: <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok?utm_source=user-menu\">StockTok Main Page</a> |</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Positions</a> |</strong></em> <em><strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a> </strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to our StockTok Dashboard, updated daily. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p><p>Other Reserources: <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a><em><strong> | </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing For Beginners Series</a> <em><strong>|</strong> </em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/90-of-traders-fail-and-100-of-them?r=4z8lgl\">Tools Tim Built for TradingView</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-frequently-asked-questions?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Screener FAQ</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/losers-dollar-cost-average-down?r=4z8lgl\">How to DCA UP!</a> </p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r3SF!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F545d5c5a-3f40-44b0-b1a1-980901ed236d_565x565.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div>",
